46
00:04:27,342 --> 00:04:33,924
So, once a prototype actually works correctly, we now have a reliable foundation for everything that will come next.

47
00:04:34,446 --> 00:04:38,564
Fixing a problem here is very simple because there are only a few

48
00:04:39,216 --> 00:04:39,556
parts.

