00:04:40,014 --> 00:04:50,016
Finding the same problem after five additional features have been built around it would just take up so much more time, and it could even force us to redo parts of the whole app.

50
00:04:50,318 --> 00:04:56,816
We have all typed in a short prompt into an AI tool, then expected it to understand the full idea in our heads.

51
00:04:56,896 --> 00:05:04,068
And then the result appears, and yes, technically it works, but it looks nothing like what we actually pictured in our brains.

52
00:05:04,462 --> 00:05:12,004
