65
00:06:13,230 --> 00:06:20,256
It should explain what the app does, what it should look like, what the user can do, and what should be left out.

66
00:06:20,622 --> 00:06:27,536
Those four details give the AI enough direction to build towards a specific result without adding unnecessary complexity.

