68
00:06:31,470 --> 00:06:39,044
Build a task management app where users can add tasks with a title, priority level of low, medium, or high, and a due date.

69
00:06:39,406 --> 00:06:43,972
Display tasks and a list grouped by priority with the highest priority at the top.

70
00:06:44,366 --> 00:06:48,900
