Add user authentication with sign up and login. Each user should only be able to see and manage their own tasks.

95
00:09:43,312 --> 00:09:49,952
All existing task functionality should work exactly as before, but scope to the logged in user.

96
00:09:50,032 --> 00:09:51,872
Do not change the existing design.

97
00:09:52,238 --> 00:09:57,636
So the prompt here now is very much more focused because the task functionality is already working.

98
